                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.002/133: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-08-17T10:00:00-04:40">August 17, 1930—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 18—1:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>93. Rafael Trujillo inaugurated President and Rafael Estrella Ureña Vice
                    President yesterday morning. Following Cabinet appointed:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
